# LaTeX: solo se versiona el PDF compilado (se ignoran las fuentes .tex y los auxiliares)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------

*.aux
*.log
*.out
*.toc
*.lof
*.lot
*.bbl
*.blg
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
